---
import ProductLayout from '../../layouts/ProductLayout.astro';
import guide from '../../data/hybridMicroPath.json';
import diagram from '../../data/hybridMicroPathDiagram.html?raw';
const media = '/media/hybrid-micropath/';
const title = 'Hybrid MicroPath negotiating techniques in calcified canal systems';
const description = 'Watch how available length, MicroPath preparation and a short pre-bend work together during 30°/30° watch winding, with a narrated 3D demonstration and five-step guide.';
const points = [
  ['Record available length', 'Use a size 8 or 10 hand file to establish the repeatable first stop.'],
  ['Give the pre-bend room', 'MicroPath enlarges the approach so tight walls do not flatten the short bend before the turn.'],
  ['Return with watch winding', 'Use the pre-bent hand file with 30° clockwise and 30° counterclockwise movements.'],
];
---
<ProductLayout title={`${title} | EndoTech NZ`} description={description} image={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16-poster.jpg`} accent="teal">
  <article class="hybrid-article">
    <header class="hybrid-hero">
      <a class="back" href="/products/micro-path/">← MicroPath</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">Clinical technique · Calcified canal systems</p>
      <h1>Hybrid MicroPath<br />negotiating techniques.</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">Available length, room for a short pre-bend, and 30°/30° watch winding.</p>
    </header>

    <aside class="key-points" aria-label="Three points in the sequence">
      <ol>{points.map(([heading,copy]) => <li><strong>{heading}</strong><span>{copy}</span></li>)}</ol>
    </aside>

    <section class="film" id="watch-winding" aria-labelledby="film-title">
      <div class="film-heading"><h2 id="film-title">Watch winding and pre-bending in motion.</h2><span>68-second narrated video</span></div>
      <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" width="1600" height="1200" poster={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16-poster.jpg`} aria-label="Narrated 3D demonstration of tight-wall straightening, MicroPath preparation and watch winding with a short pre-bend" aria-describedby="film-caption">
        <source src={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
        <source src={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16.webm`} type="video/webm" />
        <track kind="captions" srclang="en" label="English narration" src={`${media}watch-winding-narration-v16.vtt`} />
        <a href={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16.mp4`}>Open the narrated video</a>
      </video>
      <p class="caption" id="film-caption">Tight walls can straighten a pre-bend before it reaches the turn. The prepared approach gives the short bend room to reach the curve, where the returning hand file continues watch winding.</p>
      <div class="film-links"><a href={`${media}watch-winding-clinical-v16.mp4`} download>Download video</a><a href="#available">Read the five-step guide ↓</a></div>
      <details class="transcript"><summary>Read the narration</summary>{guide.transcript.map(text => <p>{text}</p>)}</details>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-intro" aria-labelledby="guide-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Five-step guide</p><h2 id="guide-title">{guide.TITLE}</h2><p>{guide.LEAD}</p>
    </section>
    <nav class="guide-nav" aria-label="Five steps">{guide.STEPS.map(([key,title],i) => <a href={`#${key}`}><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>{title}</a>)}</nav>
    <div class="steps">
      {guide.STEPS.map(([key,title,paragraphs],i) => <section class="step" id={key} aria-labelledby={`${key}-title`}>
        <div class="step-title"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h2 id={`${key}-title`}>{title}</h2></div>
        {paragraphs.map(text => <p>{text}</p>)}
        {key === 'bend' && <figure class="handfile-photo"><a href={`${media}hand-file-tip-bends-cleaned-v1.png`} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Enlarge the hand file tip-bend illustration"><img src={`${media}hand-file-tip-bends-cleaned-v1.png`} width="1235" height="1274" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Three hand files with small tip bends labelled one, two and three flutes; most of each file remains straight." /></a><figcaption>Bends over one, two and three flutes. <a href={`${media}hand-file-tip-bends-cleaned-v1.png`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Enlarge image</a>.</figcaption></figure>}
        {key === 'bypass' && <div class="diagram" set:html={diagram} />}
      </section>)}
    </div>
    <section class="other-causes"><h2>There are other reasons why a file won’t progress</h2><p>Coronal interference, a narrow canal, packed debris, a ledge, a canal division or foreign material can also prevent progress. A lost length or persistent stop needs reassessment.</p><a href="/resources/clinical-tips/">Browse clinical education →</a></section>
    <details class="technique-sources"><summary>Technique sources and product instructions</summary><p>Based on the supplied William Nudera and Jorge Vera training recordings, including the small tip bend and bypass demonstrations. Vera’s precurving example credits Bernice Ko. The MicroPath sequence is an EndoTech NZ draft teaching protocol.</p><p><a href="/downloads/EndoTech-NZ-Transform-S-MicroPath-IFU.pdf">MicroPath instructions for use</a> · <a href="/technique/motor-settings/">Motor settings</a></p></details>
    <footer class="related"><a href="/products/micro-path/">Return to MicroPath →</a><a href="/3d-solutions/micropath/">Explore the interactive 3D models →</a></footer>
  </article>
</ProductLayout>
<style>
  .hybrid-article{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:44px 28px 72px;color:#14303e}.hybrid-hero{max-width:850px;margin:0 0 30px}.back{font-size:14px;color:#086d9e;text-decoration:none}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#34666e;font-weight:600;margin:24px 0 12px}h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1.3px;margin:0 0 19px}h2{font-size:27px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.4px;margin:0 0 17px}.standfirst{font-size:21px;line-height:1.55;max-width:780px;margin:0}p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px}a{color:#086d9e;text-underline-offset:4px}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #0b75b7;outline-offset:4px}.key-points{padding:22px 24px;background:#eff6f5;border:1px solid #dae7e4;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:35px}.key-points ol{counter-reset:point;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:25px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.key-points li{counter-increment:point;min-width:0}.key-points strong{display:block;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:7px}.key-points strong::before{content:counter(point,decimal-leading-zero)' / ';color:#007d80}.key-points span{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#435e68}.film{margin:0 0 54px;scroll-margin-top:25px}.film-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px 24px;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px}.film-heading h2{font-size:23px;margin:0}.film-heading>span{font-size:13px;color:#526e78}video{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#f4f8f7;border:1px solid #dce7e8;border-radius:12px}.caption{font-size:14px;color:#526e78;line-height:1.6;margin:13px 0}.film-links{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px}.transcript{margin:22px 0 0;padding:16px 0;border-block:1px solid #dce7e8}.transcript summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}.transcript p{font-size:15px;margin:16px 0 0}.guide-intro,.steps,.other-causes,.technique-sources{max-width:800px;margin-inline:auto}.guide-intro{margin-bottom:25px}.guide-intro .eyebrow{margin-top:0}.guide-intro h2{font-size:32px}.guide-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 35px}.guide-nav a{display:flex;gap:8px;border:1px solid #d7e5e4;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.guide-nav span{color:#007d80}.step{margin-bottom:40px;scroll-margin-top:28px}.step-title{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:baseline}.step-title>span{font-size:13px;color:#007d80}.step-title h2{margin-bottom:16px}.handfile-photo{max-width:640px;margin:28px auto}.handfile-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px}figcaption{font-size:13px;color:#526e78;line-height:1.6;margin-top:12px}.other-causes{padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #dce7e8}.other-causes h2{font-size:23px}.technique-sources{font-size:13px;margin-top:30px;color:#526e78}.technique-sources summary{cursor:pointer}.technique-sources p{font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 0}.related{max-width:800px;margin:34px auto 0;display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px}
  .diagram :global(.pathfigure){background:#f5f9f9;border:1px solid #dce7e8;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin:28px 0}.diagram :global(svg){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:hidden}.diagram :global(.canal-pair){display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 34px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:start}.diagram :global(.canal-panel){min-width:0}.diagram :global(.canal-panel h3){font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;min-height:102px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#31515c}.diagram :global(.canal-panel h3 span){display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;margin-top:6px}.diagram :global(.canal-panel svg){max-width:240px;margin:auto}.diagram :global(.canal-arrow){align-self:center;margin-top:70px}.diagram :global(figcaption){font-size:13px;color:#526e78;line-height:1.6;margin-top:12px}
  @media(max-width:650px){.hybrid-article{padding:30px 20px 48px}h1{letter-spacing:-.6px}.standfirst{font-size:19px}.key-points{padding:19px}.key-points ol{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.key-points strong{margin-bottom:3px}.film{margin-bottom:38px}.film-heading h2{font-size:21px}h2{font-size:24px}.guide-intro h2{font-size:28px}.guide-nav{display:grid}.diagram :global(.pathfigure){padding:12px}.diagram :global(.canal-pair){grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.diagram :global(.canal-panel h3){min-height:0;max-width:310px;margin:0 auto 12px}.diagram :global(.canal-panel svg){max-width:190px}.diagram :global(.canal-arrow){width:30px;margin:0 auto;transform:rotate(90deg)}}
</style>
